## Synthesis

The same finite cardinality drives three effects: selection leaves $2^n-1$ alternatives, strict uniform compression fails by one pigeonhole, and sub-exhaustive search leaves an adversarial hiding place. Thermodynamic cost enters only after the logical loss is paired with a probability law and a physical reset mechanism.
